@* Code on a page (F162.1): named for its file or its language, with a button that copies it as it stands, the code
   itself as text, never read as markup. The header's layout is Bootstrap's (ADR 0085). *@
<figure class="code-listing">
    <figcaption class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3">
        <span>@Label</span>
        <button type="button" class="code-copy" @onclick="CopyAsync">@CopyWord</button>
    </figcaption>
    <pre><code class="language-@Language">@Code</code></pre>
</figure>
